# Build context of apps/{api,worker,web}/Dockerfile is the repo root. Allowlist: only what the
# images build from enters the context, so `.env*`, `supabase/signing_keys.json`, test fixtures,
# reports and local caches can never be copied into a layer (AGENTS.md §5, no baked secrets).
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!apps/api/
!apps/worker/
!apps/web/
!packages/core/
!packages/ui/
!packages/design-tokens/
!packages/api-client/

# Re-excluded inside the allowed directories.
**/.env*
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/storybook-static
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/coverage
**/Dockerfile
apps/*/tests
apps/*/test
packages/*/tests
packages/*/test
packages/core/scripts
packages/ui/.storybook
packages/ui/visual
